# DrumMania 2nd Mix (GE912 VER. JAB): the first boot, from blank NVRAM, with the install cassette in
# the slot (MAME: -cassette install; HIRAKU: --cassette install). No inputs: the CD installs to the
# onboard flash, INFO 506 by frame ~7,500. Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60
# frames, to compare with MAME.
game drmn2m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 18000 quit
